        "§18. 三角恒等式和三角方程"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "89. 同角三角函数之间的关系"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "正如你们所知道的，在正弦、余弦、正切和余切这四个三",
        "角函数之间存在三个基本关系式："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\sin^2\\alpha+\\cos^2\\alpha=1$，　(1)",
        "$\\operatorname{tg}\\alpha=\\frac{\\sin\\alpha}{\\cos\\alpha}$，　(2)",
        "$\\operatorname{ctg}\\alpha=\\frac{\\cos\\alpha}{\\sin\\alpha}$.　(3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由这些关系式可以得出它们之间的一些其他关系式。要",
        "求利用这些基本关系式证明恒等式的情形，你们已经遇到过。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于所有的值$\\alpha\\in\\boldsymbol{R}$，关系式(1)成立。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于使$\\operatorname{tg}\\alpha$有定义的所有$\\alpha$，也就是对于属于实数域$\\boldsymbol{R}$ ",
        "的所有$\\alpha$（$\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi n(n\\in\\boldsymbol{Z})$这种形式的$\\alpha$除外），(2)式成立。对"
      ]
    },
    {
